  "limits": [
    "Fresh coordinate support comes only from header polynomials. Finite samples, actual gaps, reference quality and usable normalization remain unassessed.",
    "Exact catalog-extrema midpoint/common core and January anchor remain separate from five original centers/cores/markers. No post-value expansion or fitted linewidth is introduced.",
    "All original global and later-five-window stages are true. Original local/baseline are false for 0116/0126/0130 and true for 0121/0139; later support does not rewrite failed original stages.",
    "Four batch03 originals retain U/U/U. Older 0130 retains original primary I, secondary M normalized I and baseline I, followed by later U/U/current U; no C019/0129 null-stage or original-U history is transferred.",
    "Original 0130 baseline panel is restored exactly and separately from the later wider container. This audit checks byte custody, unchanged coordinate metadata and recorded prior preservation declarations without decoding pixel values or rerunning reconstruction.",
    "Native BUNIT is absent; native flux remains instrumental without asserted calibrated ADU equivalence to merged flux. Air convention remains inherited from the extractor without a new solution.",
    "ERR is declared unavailable; no positive uncertainty support is inferred.",
    "Seven observations and five native products are reused; bounded windows disjoint from C018/C019 do not supply independent observations or prove independence of full historical crops. Original C021 epoch/raw and completed 0130 mapping evidence already existed."
  ],
